==Battleground==
*10 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Wall Doge]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kory]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring Labyrinth fodder that can tank a hit from Kory, which shouldn't be too hard to find. If you're truly worried, run some random anti-Traitless Labyrinth fodder.

